/E (Augie Dyess came to UCSD as a biology premed student and in his sophomore year found his place in Sigma Nu. After rushing, he rose through the ranks to serve as both Lieutenant Commander and Eminent Commander, leading a chapter of nearly 100 members through the full complexity of college life. It was, by his own account, the most formative experience of his time at UCSD.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
