149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Today, Augie lives in San Diego with his wife Camie and their two children, Rhette and Finn. He has been actively involved as an Alumni Advisor since the launch of the first-ever Kappa Rho Alumni Advisory Board earlier this year, attending monthly chapter meetings and working closely with a strong new Exec Board. He has been a monumental resource for our active chapter, making a positive impact in virtually every aspect of our brotherhood. We are grateful to have him in our corner as we continue to build the future of Kappa Rho.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
