/E (As Luca reflects on his time in Sigma Nu, including two years on the executive board, he recognizes how important the chapter has been in shaping who he is today. He credits the fraternity with helping him become more confident and secure in himself through the friendships and life experiences it provided. In particular, he was inspired by older members of the chapter who served as role models, showing him that dedication and ambition can coexist with enjoying life and building strong relationships.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
