/E (We are excited to share an important update from the Kappa Rho chapter of Sigma Nu at UC San Diego, the establishment of the Kappa Rho Alumni Fund, a scholarship fund created by alumni, for the brothers who carry our chapter forward today. For those of you who have not heard, this fund has already made a tangible and formative impact on this chapter.)
