<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (This year, we are proud to announce that Kai Christman, Prahlad Achar, and Bryce Arikawa, and Daniel Gallardo are the first four recipients of the Kappa Rho Alumni Fund scholarship. They received this scholarship due to their commitment, hard work, and character for this chapter. This fund gives them the ability to continue to contribute to Kappa Rho. Their commitment to the chapter and to their studies at UCSD exemplifies exactly the kind of brotherhood this fund was created to support.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (This quarter, the Kappa Rho Alumni Fund was put to work in another exciting way, funding an executive team-building obstacle course for our chapter's leadership. Designed to challenge our executive members physically and mentally, the event pushed brothers to communicate under pressure, lead with urgency, and trust one another. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 106 0 R
/E (This is what the Alumni Fund was built for. When donor dollars are invested directly into the development of our members, it not only enhances their active chapter, but sets up Kappa Rho for a success future. Thank you for all your support!)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [12]
>>
