/E (The proposal calls for 2 to 6 Alumni Advisors who would serve as mentors and industry guides. If you have a background in finance or investing and are interested in helping shape this initiative from the ground up, we would love to hear from you. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (This fund would target a 7% annual return through long-only positions in equities and fixed income, with no derivatives and no short-term trading. The vision is ambitious: starting with $10,000, the fund aims to grow to $50,000 or more over time, with the long-term dream of making Sigma Nu a cost-free fraternity for every member.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 107 0 R
/E (We are proud to share that the Kappa Rho chapter is in the process of establishing the Kappa Rho Paper Trading Fund, a proposed initiative that would give our brothers hands-on experience managing a simulated investment portfolio modeled after the Kappa Rho Legacy Foundation's Scholarship Fund. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
